==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|steinn|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|stainaz|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/steitn/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|eitn|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|steins|steinar}}

# [[stone]], [[rock]]
# [[stone]], [[pit]], [[pip]] (the seed of certain [[fruit]])
# {{medicine|lang=is}} a [[calculus]], a [[stone]]

